{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/474551-the-vampire-and-her-servant","id":474551,"title":"The Vampire and her servant","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-09T11:34:32-07:00","id":474551,"title":"The Vampire and her servant","content":"<span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">A Vampire once turned a happy, honest man into her servant.<br /> She toyed with him until she broke him, and then looked upon<br /> her twisted creation with delight.<br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> \u201cYou rejected me and I took everything away from you.<br /> Now you are mine and I am the only thing you have left.<br /> Join me in immortality, or death and oblivion await you.\u201d<br /> she said with glee, pointing a knife to his throat.<br /> <br /> \u201cIndeed I lost everything and have had no one but you<br /> for a while now. You are my friend, even if I would not<br /> have given you the choice if it was me holding the knife.<br /> But I'd rather die and forget.\u201d he whispered calmly.<br /> <br /> The Vampire, now enraged, waved around the knife<br /> threateningly, and hissed \u201cYou dare question my threat?!\u201d.<br /> Unfazed, he look away from the knife and sat by<br /> the beautiful, undead woman's side. \u201cI'll tell you why...\u201d.<br /> <br /> And tell her he did, of all that she had taken away from him:<br /> the woman he loved, the sight of the sun against her hair,<br /> the memories of friends drinking and laughing around<br /> a summer fire, his hopes and ideals.<br /> <br /> \u201cBut more than all these things, if you turn me into something<br /> like you, I will lose my most beloved enemy, my most hated friend;<br /> you. Share your curse with me and I will drink your blood until there<br /> is no more left, and reach and steal away your soul.\u201d.<br /> <br /> The Vampire furiously attacked the man, killing him and then<br /> sharing her blood, her Curse with him. And as he had promised her,<br /> he repaid the favour by grappling her neck and thrusting his fangs<br /> into her neck, drinking her blood and stealing her soul.<br /> <br /> With her soul rushing through his veins, he also saw what she had seen.<br /> The true love who spurned her, the friends she never had,<br /> the family that had abandoned her centuries ago, the wounds<br /> that a thousand years of night had not yet healed.<br /> And he cried, for they were now as one mind and soul.<br /> The memories of what was denied to her forever,<br /> would forever live inside him,<br /> next to the memories,<br /> of what he himself,<br /> had lost.<br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}